<div class="keyfind"><b>Summary</b><p class="sum">Families on river islands often get flood warnings too late, in words that do not match what they see. Solar-powered water-level sensors on a low-power radio mesh send short Bangla SMS alerts that name local landmarks.</p><ol class="rail" aria-label="Stage: Validate (3 of 5)"><li class="on"><span>Discover</span></li><li class="on"><span>Develop</span></li><li class="cur"><span>Validate</span></li><li class=""><span>Brief</span></li><li class=""><span>Implement</span></li></ol><p class="sdgline">SDGs <span class="sdgt sdgc-13" title="SDG 13: Climate Action">13</span><span class="sdgt sdgc-11" title="SDG 11: Sustainable Cities">11</span></p></div>
<h2>The problem</h2><p>Families on river islands often get flood warnings too late, in words that do not match what they see.</p><h2>The solution</h2><p>Solar-powered water-level sensors on a low-power radio mesh send short Bangla SMS alerts that name local landmarks.</p>
